# Travel partner operations. Use a PARTNER (owner or staff) token in .env (YOCABS_TOKEN).

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@partnerId = PASTE_PARTNER_ID
@bookingId = PASTE_BOOKING_ID
@driverId = PASTE_DRIVER_ID

### Bookings for my organisation
GET {{base}}/travel-partners/{{partnerId}}/bookings?status=CONFIRMED
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### Negotiation inbox
GET {{base}}/travel-partners/{{partnerId}}/negotiations?status=OFFER_SENT
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### Add a driver (creates the driver's login too)
POST {{base}}/travel-partners/{{partnerId}}/drivers
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ramesh Kumar",
  "mobile": "9000000001",
  "licenseNumber": "OD0220200012345"
}

### Assign the driver to a confirmed booking
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/driver
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverId": "{{driverId}}"
}

### Start / complete the trip (partner users or the assigned DRIVER)
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

###
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### Add staff (owner only)
POST {{base}}/travel-partners/{{partnerId}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Front desk",
  "mobile": "9000000002"
}

### Wallet (balance > 0: YoCabs owes you; < 0: you owe YoCabs commission)
GET {{base}}/travel-partners/{{partnerId}}/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### Request a payout
POST {{base}}/travel-partners/{{partnerId}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500.00
}

### Reviews and rating
GET {{base}}/travel-partners/{{partnerId}}/rating
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}

### Upload a document (multipart). ownerType: PARTNER | VEHICLE | DRIVER
POST {{base}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebKitFormBoundary

--WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ownerType"

PARTNER
--WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ownerId"

{{partnerId}}
--WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

TRADE_LICENSE
--WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="trade-license.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./trade-license.pdf
--WebKitFormBoundary--
